  "contract": [
    "The round-6 tester (Mythic): Arlokk's Vanish ends almost at once. On live (Bronzebeard Mythic, 2025-12-22) her",
    "Vanish (2118312) lasted its full 9.95 s while about 40 Earthquake, Volley, Fire Storm, Thunder Clap and other",
    "area hits landed on her. A hostile spell hit removed every stealth aura of its target, so the first area hit",
    "ended her Vanish. Here a warrior hero pulls Arlokk at the Zul'Gurub entrance on Mythic, wounds her below half",
    "health so she takes panther form and vanishes, then hits her with Thunder Clap (6343). Vanish must still be",
    "on her and she must stay hidden from the hero's client; after 10 s she steps out, visible again, and Ravages."
